---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Christaphor Box" description="Learn more about Christaphor Box.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center-safe">
      <div>
        <img class="w-64 h-64 rounded-full object-cover" src="/src/assets/Me.jpg"/>
        <!-- <p class="align-self-top text-zinc-400">[Picture coming soon]</p> -->
      </div>
      
      <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl place-self-center-safe">Hello, call me Cody.</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-3 grid justify-center gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/christaphorbox" target="_blank" class="flex justify-center items-center-safe mt-3 gap-4 group rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-9 p-3 transition hover:-translate-y-0.25 hover:border-emerald-400/40 hover:bg-zinc-900/80">
        <img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/LinkedIn_icon.svg/3840px-LinkedIn_icon.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=index&utm_content=thumbnail" alt="Linkedin Logo" width="40">
        <h2 class=" ddtext-xl leading-6 text-zinc-400">Linkedin</h2>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/BoximusMaximus" target="_blank" class="flex justify-center items-center-safe mt-3 gap-4 group rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-9 p-3 transition hover:-translate-y-0.25 hover:border-emerald-400/40 hover:bg-zinc-900/80">
        <img src="https://uxwing.com/wp-content/themes/uxwing/download/brands-and-social-media/github-white-icon.png" alt="Github Logo" width="40">
        <h2 class=" ddtext-xl leading-6 text-zinc-400">Github</h2>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@christaphorbox" target="_blank" class="flex justify-center items-center-safe mt-3 gap-4 group rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-9 p-3 transition hover:-translate-y-0.25 hover:border-emerald-400/40 hover:bg-zinc-900/80">
        <img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/YouTube_full-color_icon_%282017%29.svg/960px-YouTube_full-color_icon_%282017%29.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=index&utm_content=thumbnail" alt="YouTube Logo" width="40">
        <h2 class=" ddtext-xl leading-6 text-zinc-400">Youtube (WIP)</h2>
      </a>   
    </div>
    <div class="grid justify-center gap-5 mt-3 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="flex justify-center items-center-safe mt-3 gap-4 group rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-9 p-3" >
        <img src="https://uxwing.com/wp-content/themes/uxwing/download/communication-chat-call/phone-call-white-icon.png" alt="Linkedin Logo" width="40">
        <h2 class=" ddtext-xl leading-6 text-zinc-400">(910)431-0148</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-center items-center-safe mt-3 gap-4 group rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-9 p-3" >
        <img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Gmail_icon_%282026%29.svg/3840px-Gmail_icon_%282026%29.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=index&utm_content=thumbnail" alt="Github Logo" width="40">
        <h2 class=" ddtext-xl leading-6 text-zinc-400">Chris83337@gmail.com</h2>
      </div> 
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-950 p-6 sm:p-8">
      <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-zinc-300">
        I am a systems administrator by trade and a developer by choice. I enjoy creating full-stack
        applications and coding video games in Unity. I use my home server sled as a sandbox to
        test and develop my apps. I also use it to host game servers for players online. Feel free
        to contact me about my experience in specific fields.
      </p>
      <section class="mt-8 border-t border-white/10 pt-8" aria-labelledby="skills-heading">
        <h2 id="skills-heading" class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">Tools I work with</h2>

        <!-- Add or remove individual skills here. -->
        <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-300 sm:grid-cols-4">
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">Python</li>
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">Django</li>
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">JavaScript</li>
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">TypeScript</li>
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">React</li>
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">Astro</li>
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">Go</li>
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">Bash</li>
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">PostgreSQL</li>
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">Git / GitHub</li>
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">Proxmox</li>
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">VMware vSphere</li>
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2">Docker</li>
          <li class="rounded-md border border-white/10 px-3 py-2 text-zinc-300/40">More coming...</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/portfolio" class="rounded-md bg-emerald-400 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-black transition hover:bg-emerald-300">View portfolio</a>
        <a href="/devblog" class="rounded-md border border-white/15 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-emerald-400/40 hover:bg-white/5">Read the devblog</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
